The OpenAI oracle also failed at 96 signals. One final vendor is running; if it fails, the harness will designate the existing `medium` preset as the shipping level, and I’ll rerun every local gate at exactly those parameters.
diff --git a/gen_2410_07666.py b/gen_2410_07666.py
