codex
Rejected—no trustworthy generator should ship.

The paper’s [reconfiguration result](https://arxiv.org/html/2410.07666v1#S5) permits exponentially long witnesses; bounding the planted path loses the stated PSPACE-hardness. The alternative NAE folding-signal construction based on [Section 3.3](https://arxiv.org/html/2410.07666v1#S3.SS3) failed G6: WalkSAT solved 8/8 shipping instances, despite the oracle harness reporting `hardened`.

Evidence is preserved in:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2410.07666/REJECTED.md)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2410.07666/selftest_report.json)
- [gen_2410_07666.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2410.07666/gen_2410_07666.py)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2410.07666/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)

The report intentionally records `all_passed: false`; no misleading README or shippable artifact was produced.
